				1
			],
			"Message": "style(Maintain): Normalize em dashes to ASCII hyphens in README\n\nReplace all Unicode em dash (—) characters with ASCII hyphens (-) throughout README.md for consistency with plain-text rendering conventions in terminal and diff views. Also add the missing `title` attribute to the Star badge `<img>` element for accessibility and hover-tooltip completeness.\n\nNo behavioural changes — purely cosmetic punctuation normalization.",
			"SHA": "fb66bb24993287d401953d56c6c1c2b978f741af"
		},
