			"Message": "chore(Maintain): Update generated commit message artifact\n\nRefresh .commit_message.json to advance the pipeline artifact from the previous style-imports message to the current stage-artifact message. This file tracks the formatted commit message produced by the generation pipeline for downstream automation and review workflows.\n\nNo behavioural changes — pure housekeeping.",
